#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:1
#: 2531d7d538f1472aa055b47a4efaf327
msgid "代表性采样（最远点采样）"
msgstr "Representative sampling (Farthest Point Sampling)"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:3
#: 0cca788a6df841288bd8a0fef08b3199
msgid "界面按钮：`代表性采样`（`Sparse samples`）。"
msgstr "Interface button: `Representative Sampling` (`Sparse samples`)."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:5
#: 3e23f8ee420f42ec87c281b040dbf0b0
msgid "这个工具解决什么问题"
msgstr "What problem does this tool solve?"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:7
#: 8a10e486304b42cd8f4b7573af80312c
msgid ""
"候选池里经常有大量相似结构。最远点采样（Farthest Point Sampling，FPS）把每个"
"结构表示成一个 描述符向量，并优先选择离已有样本最远的结构，从而用较少样本覆盖"
"较大的描述符空间。"
msgstr "Candidate pools often contain many similar structures. Farthest Point Sampling (FPS) represents each structure as a descriptor vector and repeatedly chooses the structure farthest from the samples already selected, covering a larger descriptor space with fewer structures."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:10
#: 4021b974307441d682580c5616d11ae0
msgid ""
"它解决的是**冗余**，不是**数据质量**。短键、错误标签和不合理结构应先清洗，再"
"做 FPS。"
msgstr "It addresses **redundancy**, not **data quality**. Clean short bonds, incorrect labels, and unreasonable structures before running FPS."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:12
#: 54dfd3c3fef344f6bb58929d8773113b
msgid "最远点采样原理"
msgstr "How Farthest Point Sampling works"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:14
#: 40e76146ab214d998878fdd2b6981cbe
msgid ""
"设第 $i$ 个候选结构的描述符为 $\\mathbf{x}_i$，当前已经选出的描述符集合为 "
"$S$。 每一轮计算候选点到集合 $S$ 的最近距离："
msgstr "Let $\\mathbf{x}_i$ be the descriptor of candidate structure $i$, and let $S$ be the set of descriptors selected so far. At each step, compute the nearest distance from each candidate to $S$:\n"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:17
#: e15f929617d643aeaf665770c849c181
msgid ""
"\n"
"d(i,S)=\\min_{\\mathbf{x}_j\\in S}\\left\\|\\mathbf{x}_i-\\mathbf{x}"
"_j\\right\\|_2\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"d(i,S)=\\min_{\\mathbf{x}_j\\in S}\\left\\|\\mathbf{x}_i-\\mathbf{x}"
"_j\\right\\|_2\n"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:21
#: 11dee53ef5734cc8bec3a8403bbce03a
msgid "然后选择最近距离最大的候选："
msgstr "Then choose the candidate with the largest nearest distance:"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:23
#: edc6998d33524f27aaf694f4eb761344
msgid ""
"\n"
"i^\\*=\\arg\\max_{i\\notin S}d(i,S),\\qquad\n"
"S\\leftarrow S\\cup\\{\\mathbf{x}_{i^\\*}\\}\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"i^\\*=\\arg\\max_{i\\notin S}d(i,S),\\qquad\n"
"S\\leftarrow S\\cup\\{\\mathbf{x}_{i^\\*}\\}\n"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:28
#: a2b782a1f17b497bad0128df273dbae9
msgid ""
"$\\mathbf{x}_i$ 是结构级 NEP 描述符或其 PCA 坐标，没有 Å、eV 之类的物理单位。"
msgstr "$\\mathbf{x}_i$ is a structure-level NEP descriptor or its PCA coordinates; it does not have physical units such as Å or eV."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:29
#: 0cb2575d2fc24520ad2a4e47d5df0074
msgid "$\\|\\cdot\\|_2$ 是欧氏距离。"
msgstr "$\\|\\cdot\\|_2$ is the Euclidean distance."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:30
#: f29ccb51cfe5411db1e4eba01d3a3f57
msgid ""
"`最小距离`（`Min distance`）记为 $\\delta$。当所有剩余候选都满足 "
"$d(i,S)<\\delta$ 时，采样会提前停止，所以实际数量可以小于“样本上限”。"
msgstr "Let `Min distance` be $\\delta$. Sampling stops early when every remaining candidate satisfies $d(i,S)<\\delta$, so the actual count can be smaller than the sample limit."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:32
#: 35695f1c3024462288d5db7a6057e988
msgid ""
"提供“训练数据集”后，训练集描述符会作为初始集合 $S_0$。此时优先选择训练集尚未"
"覆盖的候选， 而不是重新挑一批与训练集重复的结构。"
msgstr "When a training dataset is provided, its descriptors form the initial set $S_0$. The sampler then prioritizes candidates not covered by the training set instead of selecting another batch that duplicates it."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:36
#: 176d7c85da074fba8d4030bc2c22a671
msgid ""
"`最小距离`的数值依赖当前 NEP 模型以及“原始描述符/降维后描述符”的选择，不能跨"
"模型直接复用。 更换 `nep.txt` 或描述符来源后，应重新观察距离尺度。"
msgstr "The value of `Min distance` depends on the current NEP model and on whether raw or reduced descriptors are used; it cannot be reused blindly across models. Recheck the distance scale after changing `nep.txt` or the descriptor source."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:40
#: 77c31e3469a545c0bdd2f7bd92835a09
msgid "两种选择策略"
msgstr "Two selection strategies"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:35
#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:87
#: 91f10d160b0844958226628d9bc80e0f b4c35b97bf2e4440954e5bb2b14e764a
msgid "中文界面选项"
msgstr "Chinese UI option"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:35
#: 11492d64230d4d9fb409d392895e6415
msgid "算法"
msgstr "Algorithm"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:35
#: 976f0bffba134dcb93ef2d0312ab99b5
msgid "适用场景"
msgstr "Use case"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:35
#: 09014d6f537e4057bd52057c2c34ba09
msgid "主要限制"
msgstr "Main limitation"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:35
#: 73180ff225b54f33b6966928ece72ca1
msgid "`全局 FPS（兼容模式）`"
msgstr "`全局 FPS（兼容模式）`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:35
#: 05a8e35af7874d3fb4edda3a5c60a195
msgid "所有候选共享一个 FPS 集合和总预算"
msgstr "All candidates share one FPS set and one total budget"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:35
#: 298473c96d434bc2a076586dbba580c3
msgid "数据属于同一化学体系，或希望完全复现旧流程"
msgstr "The data belong to one chemical system, or you need to reproduce the legacy workflow exactly"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:35
#: 68df7e4ffa3149b0a2bf60002ef8bca5
msgid "大数据组可能占满预算，小元素集合可能一个都选不到"
msgstr "A large group can consume the budget, leaving a small element set with no samples"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:35
#: 9dd4900e35e44b96830e259eea1ed847
msgid "`元素集合平衡 FPS`"
msgstr "`元素集合平衡 FPS`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:35
#: 6f3a19a1564d43cabde5d2c1d121b6e9
msgid "先按结构所含元素集合分组，再在每组内独立 FPS"
msgstr "Group structures by their element set, then run FPS independently within each group"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:35
#: e7fd8e043dfb4983a6b0c9e0e61c3f2f
msgid "一个候选池混有 Fe、Fe-O、Fe-Ni-O 等不同体系"
msgstr "One candidate pool mixes systems such as Fe, Fe-O, and Fe-Ni-O"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:35
#: 5814a9b3b07a4b9fac9f73aea63c3604
msgid "强制使用原始描述符和固定数量模式；样本上限不得小于元素集合组数"
msgstr "Requires raw descriptors and fixed-count mode; the sample limit must be at least the number of element-set groups"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:47
#: ef13a411849b4316805a8bf544320a21
msgid ""
"平衡策略先给每个非空元素集合一个名额。剩余预算按组大小的平方根分配。若第 $g$ "
"组有 $n_g$ 个候选，其额外名额近似满足："
msgstr "The balanced strategy first gives one slot to each non-empty element set. It distributes the remaining budget by the square root of the group size. If group $g$ has $n_g$ candidates, its additional allocation approximately satisfies:"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:50
#: 2cb6721bab304f40a40832392f122b45
msgid ""
"\n"
"q_g-1\\propto\\sqrt{n_g}\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"q_g-1\\propto\\sqrt{n_g}\n"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:54
#: a4a3672972bf43d98aafe757861eb5bb
msgid ""
"程序还会把名额限制在该组实际结构数以内，并按小数余量补齐整数预算。没有训练集"
"时，每组从最靠近 该组描述符中心的结构开始；有训练集时，只使用**元素集合完全相"
"同**的训练结构作为该组初始集合。"
msgstr "The program also caps each allocation at the number of structures in that group and rounds the integer budget using the fractional remainders. Without a training set, each group starts from the structure closest to its descriptor center; with a training set, only training structures with exactly the same element set seed that group."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:57
#: 39063c503e6b461392bc56bfd15d7fc3
msgid ""
"平方根配额比按结构数线性分配更照顾小组，但它不表示各体系同等重要。训练目标本"
"身有明确权重时， 仍应先拆分候选池或分别设定预算。"
msgstr "A square-root allocation gives small groups more consideration than a linear allocation by group size, but it does not mean that all systems are equally important. If the training objective has explicit weights, split the candidate pool or set separate budgets first."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:60
#: d4d23546a13b4650bf668120eef4c830
msgid "两种采样模式"
msgstr "Two sampling modes"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:62
#: 5e17b7c4af6246aa8d805f2729ffcd11
msgid "固定数量（FPS）"
msgstr "Fixed count (FPS)"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:64
#: 89a9c35785b44af59754d8db21fd7274
msgid "最多选择“样本上限”个结构。以下任一条件满足时提前结束："
msgstr "Select at most “Sample limit” structures. Stop early when any of the following is true:"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:66
#: 1d040333074c4492b39b9c772532972a
msgid "已达到样本上限；"
msgstr "The sample limit has been reached;"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:67
#: a2be8cc4efc44e4db27b894a763a4dba
msgid "候选已用完；"
msgstr "No candidates remain;"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:68
#: a65fab9436d4461193e6c43b0ba6d423
msgid "最大最近距离小于“最小距离”。"
msgstr "The largest nearest distance is below “Min distance”."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:70
#: 1d1ddea2cb4d46bb95814bcf15fb90af
msgid "因此“样本上限”是上限，不是保证数量。"
msgstr "Therefore, “Sample limit” is a cap, not a guaranteed count."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:72
#: c9993ec8ddbf4545bd7a55ebdc6270d4
msgid "$R^2$ 停止（FPS）"
msgstr "$R^2$ stopping (FPS)"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:74
#: d5b98cda93784df7a47d4a51d938e96e
msgid ""
"只在“全局 FPS”中可选。程序每轮仍按 FPS 选点，但会计算当前实现定义的描述符方差"
"覆盖分数："
msgstr "This option is available only for “Global FPS”. The program still selects points by FPS, but also computes the descriptor-variance coverage score defined by the current implementation:"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:76
#: 6552f960dc144c9485775332fbcf3552
msgid ""
"\n"
"R^2_{\\mathrm{cover}}\n"
"=\n"
"\\frac{\\sum_{i\\in S}\\left\\|\\mathbf{x}_i-\\bar{\\mathbf{x}}\\right\\|"
"_2^2}\n"
"{\\sum_{i=1}^{N}\\left\\|\\mathbf{x}_i-\\bar{\\mathbf{x}}\\right\\|_2^2},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\bar{\\mathbf{x}}=\\frac{1}{N}\\sum_{i=1}^{N}\\mathbf{x}_i\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"R^2_{\\mathrm{cover}}\n"
"=\n"
"\\frac{\\sum_{i\\in S}\\left\\|\\mathbf{x}_i-\\bar{\\mathbf{x}}\\right\\|"
"_2^2}\n"
"{\\sum_{i=1}^{N}\\left\\|\\mathbf{x}_i-\\bar{\\mathbf{x}}\\right\\|_2^2},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\bar{\\mathbf{x}}=\\frac{1}{N}\\sum_{i=1}^{N}\\mathbf{x}_i\n"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:85
#: ccbc103c14cb428f9f75cc28f0d426a4
msgid ""
"当 $R^2_{\\mathrm{cover}}$ 达到“$R^2$ 阈值”时停止；“样本上限”和“最小距离”仍然"
"同时生效。"
msgstr "Stop when $R^2_{\\mathrm{cover}}$ reaches the “$R^2$ threshold”; “Sample limit” and “Min distance” remain active at the same time."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:88
#: 5727d9a1bc2a42789f5240d4ed8ebfec
msgid ""
"这里的 $R^2_{\\mathrm{cover}}$ 是 NepTrainKit 的**描述符方差覆盖停止指标**，"
"不是回归模型的决定系数， 也不是重构误差。它偏重远离描述符均值的点，不能单独证"
"明训练误差已经收敛。"
msgstr "Here $R^2_{\\mathrm{cover}}$ is NepTrainKit's **descriptor-variance coverage stopping metric**. It is not the coefficient of determination of a regression model and not a reconstruction error. It emphasizes points far from the descriptor mean, so it cannot by itself show that training error has converged."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:92
#: 565bcb04b5ca42c5a0e40d0929779a03
msgid "描述符来源"
msgstr "Descriptor source"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:87
#: c2109938a1e54534982cb69776880218
msgid "实际距离空间"
msgstr "Actual distance space"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:87
#: a9e133406c054d0184e8beeead101178
msgid "效果"
msgstr "Effect"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:87
#: 2b2d521e0a1f432ab4a00430c9ffa9f9
msgid "`降维后（PCA）`"
msgstr "`降维后（PCA）`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:87
#: dbb0a2e5c9564cdeaa3b6bb5400cc6d3
msgid "当前数据的 PCA 坐标；合并训练集时会在候选与训练描述符上联合降到二维"
msgstr "PCA coordinates of the current data; when a training set is included, candidates and training descriptors are reduced jointly to two dimensions"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:87
#: f59f2e9a7e1146d6a51f6fd90c5100c5
msgid "速度快、便于和叠加图对应，但降维可能丢失低方差方向"
msgstr "Fast and easy to compare with the overlay plot, but dimensionality reduction can lose low-variance directions"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:87
#: 8bfbe11f92084e1a961394c2f0e0ecdf
msgid "`原始描述符`"
msgstr "`原始描述符`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:87
#: 3d9c7d134ceb439a82a393ccb93ffc36
msgid "缓存的结构级原始描述符"
msgstr "Cached structure-level raw descriptors"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:87
#: 3d3e719ede544951b9606cd9d113126d
msgid "保留完整描述符信息，但距离尺度随维度和模型变化"
msgstr "Preserves the full descriptor information, but the distance scale changes with dimensionality and the model"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:99
#: 5cea20fc3ede4ec4a5a8bb1a427dd33b
msgid ""
"如果请求原始描述符但当前没有缓存，程序会提示并回退到降维空间。元素集合平衡 "
"FPS 不允许这种回退； 缺少原始描述符时会停止并报错。"
msgstr "If raw descriptors are requested but no cache is available, the program reports this and falls back to the reduced space. Element-set-balanced FPS does not allow this fallback; it stops with an error when raw descriptors are missing."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:102
#: 6a3c775bf8bd4b4797a0b4c1fe76635f
msgid "“将当前选择作为区域”到底做什么"
msgstr "What does “Use current selection as region” actually do?"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:104
#: 78da364051ef4baf82f4fbd8cae72fa4
msgid ""
"这个选项不是“把当前选择当作已经保留的训练集”，而是把当前选中的结构限制为**本"
"次 FPS 的候选区域**："
msgstr "This option does not treat the current selection as an already-retained training set. Instead, it restricts the current selection to the **candidate region for this FPS run**:"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:106
#: 3d3d9419b02b403e9b52eb5ac451c290
msgid "先在主图上选中想清理的局部点群。"
msgstr "First select the local cluster of points you want to clean on the main plot."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:107
#: 04b6f5a2eac24728ab385be431ad450f
msgid "勾选“将当前选择作为区域”并运行 FPS。"
msgstr "Check “Use current selection as region” and run FPS."

